-- The request machine (S7, Q-S7-3 (a)): the cocell signature Machine of
-- domain/domain.lang, with the closed label domain Req (a List U256). A
-- guest program outside the kit cannot name nil or cons (rule R1), so this
-- example is in examples/kit.txt. counter counts the requests. The step
-- does not read the words of the request, so eps after two steps is two.
def counter : Machine Size := mCorec Size Size (fun (s : Size) => s) (fun (s : Size) (r : Req) => szS s) sz0
def counterAt2 : Size := eps Size (mStep Size (mStep Size counter nil) (cons 7u nil))
